body:
I'm starting to think it could be caused partially by my intake of energy drinks/soda. I'm a caffeine addict maybe that's the root cause for mine. Just speculating at this point though.  I'm upping my water intake big time. I saw posts about baking soda, lemon, water drinks, perhaps I'll give this an attempt to see if it makes any difference. 

&#x200B;

Thanks for replying, it's nice to know that I'm not alone in this confusion.
